{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nku0nib","type":"work","title":"兩山墨談","authors":[{"name":"陳霆","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9behl"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《兩山墨談》•十八卷","author_info":"明陳霆撰","summary":"明陳霆撰。霆有《唐餘紀傳》，已著錄。是書考證古籍，頗為詳贍，而持論每涉偏駁。如據《國語》王子晉厲宣、幽、平之言，謂周宣與萬、幽、平相等，謂許衡、姚樞不當仕元，謂至正二十六年即當削元之統，皆乖謬殊甚。又輕信小說，如紅線、蘇小妹之類，並引為故實。至於據《政和縣誌》所載余應詩，以元順帝為瀛國公子，益荒誕矣。","edition":"兩淮鹽政采進本"},{"source":"明史藝文志","source_bid":"d59f2mox0000","title_info":"陈霆《两山墨谈》十八卷","summary":"陳霆《兩山墨談》十八卷"},{"source":"國史經籍志","source_bid":"d59f2nl40936","title_info":"《兩山墨談》八卷","summary":"《兩山墨談》八卷（劇霆）","author_info":"劇霆"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《兩山墨談》十八卷","author_info":"明陳霆撰","summary":"《兩山墨談》十八卷。明陳霆撰。影印天津圖書館藏明嘉靖十八年李檗刻本。","edition":"影印天津圖書館藏明嘉靖十八年李檗刻本","volume":"第1143冊","section":"子部 雑家類"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《兩山墨談》十八卷","author_info":"明陳霆撰","summary":"《兩山墨談》十八卷。明陳霆撰。天津圖書館藏明嘉靖十八年李檗刻本。","edition":"天津圖書館藏明嘉靖十八年李檗刻本","volume":"第96冊","section":"子部"}],"juan_count":{"number":18},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-jiajingshibalibokebe","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02096084","metadata":{"edition":"嘉靖十八年李檗刻本","version":"v6","total_page":510,"paragraph_count":484,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-guangxuershierchangs","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL01023957","metadata":{"edition":"光緒二十二年长沙本","version":"v4","total_page":388,"paragraph_count":1239,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-jiajingshibalibokebe-1","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02056305","metadata":{"edition":"嘉靖十八年李檗刻本","version":"v2","total_page":519,"paragraph_count":4527,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02096084.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name